cases.scenario:
A backend engineer shares this proposed API for a file-processing service:

```
POST /process
Request: { "file_id": "abc123", "output_format": "pdf", "internal_queue_name": "conversion-prod-v2" }
Response 200: { "job_id": "job_987", "db_row_id": 441, "status": "queued", "internal_worker": "worker-07" }
Errors: { "error": "something went wrong" }
```

The service enqueues the file for async conversion. A client should be able to poll later for the result.
